  {
    "episode_id": 92776,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92776.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "When I called up Congressman Jamie Raskin last week, I had a whole list of questions for him. He's a Democrat. He was in charge of Donald Trump's second impeachment. So you can imagine that right now, this guy would have a lot to say. But I'd also heard that Raskin is a voracious reader, a fan of Shakespeare. So before we get into all that, I asked what book he had on his bedside table. This excited him.",
