        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Asking about someone’s bedside reading reveals something meaningful about their character or mindset.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes that personal details can humanize political figures.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Raskin's excitement suggests alignment between the speaker’s approach and Raskin’s self-perception.",
