  },
  {
    "episode_id": 92776,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92776.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, well in some sense it's just never really ended and You know, for most of human history, people have lived under kings and queens and monarchs and dictators, and not everybody believes that there's anything wrong with that, and not everybody believes that we can actually govern ourselves.",
