        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Raskin possesses natural fluency with the mechanisms of American political power.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "During his campaign, Raskin claimed the current election would shape American politics for the remainder of the century.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Raskin is unafraid to use political power when necessary.",
