    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92776.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 21,
    "turn_text": "We're speaking on Thursday, November 14th. This interview will air a couple of weeks after Donald Trump's reelection. And there are so many takes out there as to why Democrats lost. There are people like Bernie Sanders saying the party drifted too far away from the working class. There are people like David Plough putting the blame squarely on in Biden's lap saying he stayed in too long. I wonder where you lie",
