  {
    "episode_id": 92776,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92776.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 27,
    "turn_text": "You know, I think in the past, our lack of collective imagination when it comes to Donald Trump has really benefited him. You know, I thought about this recently because just the other day when Trump met with congressional leaders, he joked about potentially seeking a third term as president. And I feel like that's how a lot of ideas, wild ideas enter the conversation when it comes to Donald Trump. I'm curious what you are imagining next and what you think my listeners should imagine, not to scare them, but to prepare them and maybe be practical.",
