      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker’s campaign visited 27 states and participated in numerous events.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "An answer provided five minutes after the election would be meaningless.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Those who didn't vote would have voted for the Democratic candidate.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "An answer provided five days after the election would also be meaningless.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "One cannot rely solely on instinct ('gut') to understand the election outcome.",
